# 줄바꿈 고정: Mac 셸 스크립트는 LF 필수(CRLF면 "bad interpreter" 오류), Windows 배치·PowerShell은 CRLF
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.command   text eol=lf
*.mjs       text eol=lf
*.js        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
*.png       binary
*.pdf       binary
*.zip       binary
